{"id":"u-3ce991e8-1f10-444e-a546-27c192ae6997","src":"community","title":"Benchsmith: Forged for Strength","author":"","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/85rJFk-8weekbenchmuscleprogram","desc":"**Benchsmith: Forged for Strength** is an 8-week bench press specialization program designed to help intermediate and advanced lifters build both maximal pressing strength and upper-body muscle.\n\nThe program combines progressive overload, intelligently managed volume, and varied intensity to drive consistent progress while minimizing unnecessary fatigue. Rather than relying on random workouts or testing your one-rep max every week, Benchsmith follows a structured progression that develops technique, power, and confidence under the bar.\n\nEach training week is carefully planned to balance heavy compound work with targeted accessory exercises for the chest, shoulders, triceps, and upper back. These supporting movements strengthen the muscles that contribute most to a bigger bench press while promoting balanced development and long-term joint health.\n\nBenchsmith is intended for lifters who already have a solid foundation in the bench press and are ready to move beyond beginner linear progression. Whether your goal is to hit a new personal record, break through a plateau, or simply build a stronger and more muscular upper body, this program provides a clear roadmap from your first session to your final max attempt.\n\nSuccess with Benchsmith comes from consistency. Trust the process, focus on quality technique, recover well, and attack every session with intent. Every workout is another strike of the hammer—forge enough of them, and exceptional strength will follow.","level":["Beginner","Novice"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":70,"joins":2,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-07-09T03:54:02.558Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Bench Press Focus (Chest & Triceps)","Back & Biceps","Leg Day (Main)","Semi Leg Day + Bench","Should